PROFESSIONAL SERVICES AGREEMENT
for
Occupational Medicine
THIS AGREEMENT is made and entered into this
day of
by and between the City of Cheyenne, located at 2101 O'Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming
,2022,
82001 ("City"), and Nova Health Care Center, located at 1919 Central Avenue, Cheyenne,
Wyoming 82001 ("Consultant").
RECITALS
In consideration of the mutual covenants and obligations herein expressed, it is agreed by and
between the parties asfollows:
1.
SCOPEOFWORK
The Consultant agrees to provide services as described for the above-mentioned project,
in accordance with the Scope of Work attached hereto as Exhibit A, incorporated by
reference and expressly made apart hereof.
2.
TIME OF PERFORMANCE
The work included in this Scope of Work will be completed one year from the date of
execution of this Agreement, as stated in Exhibit A.
3.
COMPENSATION
In consideration of the services to be performed pursuant to this Agreement, the
Consultant will bill the City and the City agrees topay Consultant a not to exceed amount
of Eleven Thousand Dollars ($11,000.00) as stated in Exhibit A.
4
CONSULTANT RESPONSIBILITY
In providing services under this Agreement, the Consultant shall perform in a manner
consistent with that degree of care and skill ordinarily exercised by members of the same
profession currently practicing under similar c irc um stan ccs.Upon notice to the
Consultant, the Consultant will, without additional compensation, correct those services
not meeting such a standard.
5.
COMPLIANCE WITH LAWS
The Parties agree that they will perform their obligations as provided in this Agreement
in accordance with all applicable laws and ordinances.
