person, destruction or damage to any property, contamination of or advcrse effects on the
environment, or any violation of g over m mental laws, regulations, or orders to the extent
caused by (1) the Consultant's breach of any term or provision of this Agreement; or (2)
any ncgligent or wrongful act, error, or omission by the Consultant, or its employees or
sub-consultants in the performance of this Agreement.The Consultant acknowledges
that it may incur a financial obligation to the City pursuant to the terms of this paragraph.
8.
